{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world overrun by the undead, the Hollow Monks have emerged\u2014ethereal warriors with only robes and a singular purpose: to eradicate the <strong>Nasty Zombies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight alone or in teams of <strong>up to 4 people</strong>, uncover hidden secrets, and unlock dozens of achievements. Master a fast-paced arsenal, from powerful melee combat to <strong>akimbo weapons</strong>, and enhance your abilities by unlocking <strong>perks and game-changing power-ups</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After unlocking them all, <strong>prestige </strong>to prove your mastery\u2014each prestige level increases the number of perks you can equip at once, letting you build even deadlier loadouts. Climb the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, competing for <strong>highest wave, fastest speedruns, and top prestige ranks</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customise your monk with a variety of unlockable <strong>hats and heads</strong>, and personalise your arsenal with <strong>weapon camos</strong>. Whether you prefer a menacing look or something more stylish, there\u2019s always a way to stand out in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Wave.png?t=1744585877\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Defend.gif?t=1744585877\" />The classic wave-based zombie survival formula you know and love\u2014amped up with high-speed movement and a retro twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/TestYourSkill.png?t=1744585877\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/mobility.gif?t=1744585877\" />Master a fast-paced movement system where agility is your greatest weapon! <strong>Harness the Kinetic Energy system</strong>, gaining increased firepower and melee speed as you stay on the move. Leap over obstacles, slide under walls, and air dash to outmaneuver the undead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Random.png?t=1744585877\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/RandomLayouts.gif?t=1744585877\" />Experience <strong>endless replayability</strong> with dynamically generated map layouts that change every match. No two runs are ever the same\u2014adapt to shifting environments, discover new pathways, and strategise on the fly as you fight to survive the undead horde.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Upgrades.png?t=1744585877\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Perks2.gif?t=1744585877\" />Earn money by killing zombies, then spend it on Perks and Power-Ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 12 Perks and 9 Power-Ups to choose from.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Perks</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bandolier:</strong> Increased Ammo Storage &amp; More Ammo Per Purchase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Carpenter:</strong> Repair Barricades Faster &amp; More Securely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gunslinger:</strong>  Switch Weapons Faster &amp; Reload Holstered Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardened Flesh:</strong> Increased Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kinetic Recovery:</strong>\u00a0Kinetic energy reduces Health Eegeneration Delay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rapid Reload:</strong> Reload Faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retribution:</strong> Explosive Second Chance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruction:</strong> Starter Weapons are Stronger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scavenger:</strong> Scavenge Ammo from Dead Zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vengeance:</strong> Rebound Taken Damage to Attacking Zombie\u2019s Heads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Z-Ray Vision:</strong> See Zombies Through Walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zoomies:</strong> No Crouch Speed Penalty &amp; Move Faster</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Power-Ups</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nuke:</strong> Kill All Zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Max Ammo:</strong> Refill All Ammo &amp; Kinetic Energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insta-Kill:</strong> Zombies Die in One Hit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bottomless Clip:</strong>\u00a0Unlimited Ammo &amp; Kinetic Energy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Necrovore:</strong> Inflicted Damage Heals You</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zillionaire:</strong> Double Money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vitality Surge:</strong> Boost Your Health &amp; Speed Above Max</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fortify:</strong> Repairs &amp; Electrifies All Barricades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chronopulse:</strong> Time Slows in Proximity to Zombies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Leaderboards.png?t=1744585877\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851700/extras/Stats2.gif?t=1744585877